high contention of threads in the worker pool, pipeline compilation for ubershaders takes an unnecessary backseat and can cause significant delays in the main thread. This PR marks compilation of any ubershader pipelines as high priority to mitigate this issue.\r\n\r\nAs indicated to the OP however, the issue itself is a bit more of a content issue, but regardless, the improvement should help in scenarios where it is critical for the game to be responsive compared to other tasks that might've been launched by the project.\r\n\r\nWe should probably test for no regressions in loading times to be found on existing projects when using no pipeline cache and clean driver caches.\r\n\r\n_Bugsquad edit: Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101844_","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","number":20,"state":"closed","title":"4.4","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"http